	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "[ver 1.1.0] \n- [Connector EXP] Change SPI -> RS422\n- [Connector Interface] Add FPGA LVDS Connector\n- [MPU] Change SAMA7D65 - >SAMA7G54\n- [Common] Add SPI Switch LVDS TX RX, add UART Switch\n- [USB Switch] Change Logic to Input Output NCM Forward USB, add Host USB, add Switch/DNP Logic\n- [Debug] Return Default Port\n- [Temperature] Add 4 NTC\n- [LVDS] Minor\n- [FPGA] Add FPGA, Add Power Unit FPGA, Add SPI Flash that could programing FPGA from MPU, Add Pin Logic for LVDS Converter, Add future feature SpaceWire\n"
